WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,360
Public opinion is now very unfavorable to Qingzhou’s career, and you know it too.

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:05,360
Qingzhou can reach this position now

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,720
how much effort you put in

4
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:09,890
I know it's not easy for him

5
00:00:10,290 --> 00:00:11,450
But he can't

6
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:13,770
Step on your sister and get the upper hand, grandma

7
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,330
It's okay with me

8
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:17,330
Look at Jiaojiao

9
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:18,410
How sensible she is

10
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:21,780
I can't let her be wronged anymore.

11
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,380
I'll solve my own problems

12
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:24,780
But I want to ask something

13
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,980
What will you say about Youyou’s identity to the outside world in the future?

14
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:28,380
As soon as you come back

15
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:30,460
Qingzhou has a career crisis

16
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,780
Doesn't this explain more

17
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,260
Is she a disaster?

18
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,540
As long as the relatives know

19
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:40,300
There's no need to make it known to everyone, right, right?

20
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:41,820
Yoyo is still young

21
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,020
too much attention

22
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,540
Not good for her growth

23
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,520
Then I'll take care of it

24
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:54,630
When I first came home

25
00:00:54,630 --> 00:00:56,550
I like my grandparents very much

26
00:00:57,220 --> 00:01:00,900
But my grandparents don’t like me. I don’t want to be internally dissatisfied.

27
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:02,460
It's because the old lamp has no discernment

28
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:08,660
they don't like me

29
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:10,420
Then I don’t want to like them either.

30
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:12,020
Please stay

31
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:14,580
I have a gift for the little donor

32
00:01:14,940 --> 00:01:16,260
Jiaojiao, go quickly

33
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:18,580
Remember to thank Master Miao Kong

34
00:01:18,780 --> 00:01:20,260
Please forgive me, little benefactor.

35
00:01:20,460 --> 00:01:22,460
My gift is not for you
